      {
        "text": "While budgeting his remaining primeval stones, Fang Yuan prices green copper Relic Gu at two thousand primeval stones, red steel at eight thousand, white silver at fifty thousand, and yellow gold at close to three hundred thousand. Relic Gu are natural Gu and cannot be refined by Gu Masters.",
